// Golden output of the macro strip with no added-sugar `_meta`, rendered by
// the shared/i18n.js + shared/macros.js + English strings of the commit
// BEFORE added sugar existed (63397297). The added-sugar brief promises that a
// widget without `_meta` renders byte for byte what it did before the sugars
// row, and a test comparing the new code with itself cannot show that — this
// fixture can. Regenerate it only from that pre-change code, never from the
// working tree, or it pins nothing.
